# Travel Hub and Home Assistant

This repo is the single copy of the planner. Home Assistant shows that copy
from `/config/trip_planner` on `192.168.1.144`:
`http://192.168.1.144:8123/travel-hub/`.

`travel_hub.db` in this repo is the only trip list. Do not keep a second list
in a Home Assistant calendar, automation, or YAML file.

After any change here, including trips, sync before the task is done:

```text
python scripts/sync_ha_planner.py
```

The sync reads trips from the NUC into this database, then copies this repo's
planner and database to the NUC and restarts it. A newer save on the NUC
updates the matching trip here. A trip removed here is removed on the NUC at
the next sync.

A Cursor `stop` hook runs `python scripts/sync_ha_planner.py --if-stale`.

A trip shows on a family calendar feed only when its saved traveler names
include that family.
